anneal_profile() conserves dose exactly, matches the real Gaussian-diffusion broadening formula, is genuinely temperature-dependent (not just elapsed time), accumulates correctly across repeated anneal calls, and uses the profile's own host_material (not a hardcoded 'Si') for D(T). Its resolution channel correctly reports VERIFIED in-window and UNVERIFIED out-of-window (final-review Fix 1).
